sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User (CLI)
    participant Merchant as MerchantAgent (10013)
    participant Labeler as LabelerAgent (10010)
    participant Wrapper as WrapperAgent (10011)
    participant Packer as PackerAgent (10012)

    Note over User,Merchant: 1. User submits a Purchase Order via CLI (cmd.py)
    User->>Merchant: Send JSON-RPC task\n(purchase order)

    Note over Merchant: 2. MerchantTaskManager receives task and invokes MerchantAgent
    Merchant->>Labeler: Send task (orderId + address)\nfor shipping label

    Note over Labeler: 3. LabelerTaskManager -> LabelerAgent\n→ Generates LABEL-{orderId}-{timestamp}
    Labeler-->>Merchant: Return label payload

    Note over Merchant,Wrapper: 4. For each item → send wrapping task
    loop For each item in PO
        Merchant->>Wrapper: Send task (orderId, itemId, item)
        Wrapper->>Wrapper: Decide wrapping: fragile → bubble-wrap\nelse → paper
        Wrapper-->>Merchant: Return wrapped item info
    end

    Note over Merchant,Packer: 5. Send label + wrapped item to Packer
    loop For each wrapped item
        Merchant->>Packer: Send label payload
        Merchant->>Packer: Send wrapped item payload

        Note over Packer: 6. PackerAgent stores both\n→ Calls try_pack(orderId, itemId)
        Packer-->>Merchant: Return pack confirmation
    end

    Note over Merchant: 7. Aggregate all results
    Merchant-->>User: Final response: List of packed items